    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1076">

                <pb facs="1100" n="980" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg980"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Hutchinson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation.</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-05-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 27, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 418.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of the Department’s cablegram of May 22; [printed ante]; and my reply of the
                    following day [printed ante].</p>
                <p>In further connection with these cablegrams I beg to inclose a copy of the
                    above-mentioned decision. By next mail I shall be able to forward the
                    translation, which is difficult and complicated.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norman
                    Hutchinson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1076-a1.xml" xpointer="d1076-a1"/>
            </div>
